            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Dr. Howard Brody, a leader in bioethics and medical humanities, describes how human touch impacts pain management outcomes. The symbolism of positive meaning versus negative meaning and how they effect patients' perception of pain are explored.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
